  "body": "## What changed\n\n- `crates/ui/src/machine_modes.rs`: `short_caption` gets an explicit\n  `MachineKind::Waterjet => \"Waterjet\"` arm. No wildcard arm.\n- `crates/ui/src/egui_app/machine_mode_tests.rs`: new test\n  `every_machine_kind_has_a_short_caption` asserts a non-empty short and\n  full caption for each of the seven kinds, and the Waterjet short word.\n- `docs/decisions/2143-waterjet-caption.md`: the word choice and the\n  no-ribbon-row decision.\n\nMain did not build: E0004 in `short_caption` (PR #2001 added the kind,\nthe match was not extended).\n\n## Build and test results\n\n- `cargo check -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -j 6`: clean (exit 0).\n- `cargo check -p camcraft-app --all-targets -j 6`: clean (exit 0), no\n  other non-exhaustive match found.\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-ui --lib machine_mode`: 9 passed, 0 failed.\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-ui --lib -- --exact egui_app::machine_mode_tests::every_machine_kind_has_a_short_caption`: 1 passed.\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -j 6 -- -D warnings`: clean.\n\nNot exercised: the full ui suite, the app test suites, the snapshot lane\n(no PNG changed).\n\nChangelog: none\n\nEffort: low\n\nFixes #2143\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
